-noodles"],["Cholada Thai","dish/cholada-thai"],["Drunken noodles","dish/drunken-noodles"],["E-san Thai Cuisine","dish/e-san-thai-cuisine"],["Evil jungle prince","dish/evil-jungle-prince"],["Fish sauce","dish/fish-sauce"],["Green curry","dish/green-curry"],["Hainanese chicken rice","dish/hainanese-chicken-rice"],["Jay Fai","dish/jay-fai"],["Khanom babin","dish/khanom-babin"],["Khanom chin","dish/khanom-chin"],["Khanom thuai","dish/khanom-thuai"],["Khao soi","dish/khao-soi"],["Kiin Kiin","dish/kiin-kiin"],["La tiang","dish/la-tiang"],["Lotus of Siam","dish/lotus-of-siam"],["Mi krop","dish/mi-krop"],["Miang kham","dish/miang-kham"],["Nam ngiao","dish/nam-ngiao"],["Nam tok (food)","dish/nam-tok-food"],["PaaDee","dish/paadee"],["Pad see ew","dish/pad-see-ew"],["Pad thai","dish/pad-thai"],["Rad naa","dish/rad-naa"],["Rice noodle roll","dish/rice-noodle-roll"],["Sorn (restaurant)","dish/sorn-restaurant"],["Sweet chili sauce","dish/sweet-chili-sauce"],["Thai curry","dish/thai-curry"],["Thai Express","dish/thai-express"],["Thali","dish/thali"],["Thua nao","dish/thua-nao"],["Tom kha kai","dish/tom-kha-kai"],["Tom yum","dish/tom-yum"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/f/f5/Khao_phat_kaeng_khiao_wan.jpg/500px-Khao_phat_kaeng_khiao_wan.jpg","w":500,"h":373,"by":"Takeaway","lic":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Khao_phat_kaeng_khiao_wan.jpg"}},"dish/yangnyeom-chicken":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/yangnyeom-chicken","n":"Yangnyeom chicken","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from South Korean cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":[["Yangnyeom chicken is a variety of Korean fried chicken seasoned with a sweet and spicy sauce of gochujang, garlic, sugar, and other spices. It is often eaten as anju, food consumed while drinking, in South Korea."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-yangnyeom-chicken"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yangn